 "world": "Corporate travel managers evaluate charter flight providers, maritime carriers, and regional shuttle services for transport contracts.",
 "rationale": {
  "m_debe": [
   "AeroWay Express satisfies the charter accreditation requirement by operating a fleet size of 12 jets, exceeding the 10 jet threshold.",
